     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear All<div><br></div><div>I am working on some project with images and met one problem.</div><div>In the Question Title, I mentioned the problem with appendSpeciesName, but it is something, I met every time I want to use metadata from images</div><div><br></div><div>When I want to add species names to images I have, I run the following code</div><div><br></div><div><div>&gt;appendSpeciesNames(inDir = ...Directory_with_images..., </div><div>+                   IDfrom = &quot;metadata&quot;,</div><div>+                   metadataSpeciesTag = &quot;Species&quot;,</div><div>+                   hasCameraFolders = F)</div></div><div><br></div><div>but I receive this error </div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error: File not found - NA\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error: File not found - \r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in `$&lt;-.data.frame`(`*tmp*`, &quot;filename_new&quot;, value = &quot;.JPG&quot;) : \r\n  replacement has 1 row, data has 0\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In addition: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning messages:\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">1: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In system(command.tmp, intern = TRUE) :\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> running command &#39;exiftool -t -q -r -f -Directory -FileName -HierarchicalSubject -ext JPG &quot;NA&quot;&#39; had status 1\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">2: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In system(command.tmp, intern = TRUE) :\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> running command &#39;exiftool -t -q -r -f -Directory -FileName -HierarchicalSubject -ext JPG &quot;&quot;&#39; had status 1</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font color=\"#000000\">The last two warning messages appear also when I want to record a table.</font></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I read everything I found about this topic and tried everything. The problem is not solved yet.</span><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font color=\"#000000\">More info that may be helpful:</font></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font color=\"#000000\">1. I have Ubuntu 18.04.3 LTS</font></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font color=\"#000000\">2. I reinstalled ExifTools, restart R and restart my laptop after reinstalletion</font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. When I run </font></span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><b>Sys.which(&quot;exiftool&quot;) </b>I have<b> </b></span></font><b>exiftool </b></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25\"><b>                                     &quot;/usr/local/bin/exiftool&quot; </b></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25\"><pre style=\"border-width:initial;border-style:none;outline:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">4. When I run </font><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Ubuntu Mono, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><b>Sys.which(&quot;exiftool.exe&quot;)</b> I receive </span></font><b>exiftool.exe </b></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><b>                                                  &quot;&quot;</b></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\">(It may be obvious considering my OS)</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\">5. When I run <b>system(&quot;exiftool&quot;)</b> I get <b>Syntax:  exiftool [OPTIONS] FILE</b></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><b>                                       Consult the exiftool documentation for a full list of options.</b></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><b><br></b></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">So, sorry for any disturbance, but I am running out of any ideas</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">Hope, there are people who had the same problem and know how to solve this problem</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\">All the best</span></pre></pre></div></div>"
